{"asset_key":"ep3/env_story_13309030","episode":"ep3","category":"env_story","story_id":"13309030","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1330903001:1":{"text":"君を責めるつもりはない。ただ合理的な説明をしてくれと言ってるだけだ。なぜ大公に面会できない？","source_cn":"我无意为难你，但你必须给我一个合理的理由。告诉我，为何...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4BC1F75A99031CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1330903002:1":{"text":"……申し訳ございません、子爵様。これは宮廷からの命令なのです。","source_cn":"……很抱歉，子爵大人，这是来自帝国皇庭的命令。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0452818BAC9E72A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1330903003:1":{"text":"なに？宮廷だと！？あぁ、デューラ様。いったい何が……","source_cn":"什么？皇庭？！艾雅在上，到底发生了什么……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF94FEF20E9F5087","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1330903004:1":{"text":"お許しください。り……理由は言えません！貴殿の安全のためにも、どうかお戻りください。","source_cn":"请您原谅，我……我不能说。为了您的安全，还请您先离开。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6FDE06ECCF768EE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:扎瓦茨基子爵":{"text":"ザヴァツキー子爵","source":"扎瓦茨基子爵","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卫兵卡鲁":{"text":"衛兵のカル","source":"卫兵卡鲁","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}